### Create Employee
POST https://empapp-zva5.onrender.com/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Anurag",
    "email": "anurag@example.com",
    "mobile": 9999999999,
    "designation": "Software Engineer",
    "companyName": "ABC Corp"
}


### Read Employees
GET https://empapp-zva5.onrender.com/employee

